CheckModuleTransaction_AgentOwner_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when AgentOwner is the module
│   └── it should pass a call to the agent's own Safe
├── when the module call has run
│   └── it should check nothing after it
└── when another module calls
    ├── given the agent is frozen
    │   └── it should revert with AgentInactive
    ├── given the agent is removed
    │   └── it should revert with AgentInactive
    ├── when it calls the agent's own Safe
    │   └── it should revert with AgentSelfCall
    ├── when it delegatecalls
    │   └── it should revert with AgentSelfCall
    └── when it calls another address
        └── it should pass
